{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-1\",\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"“想冲出去”把 B1 中“像想往前走”的运动比喻强化成了他实际想做的冲出动作；其余怒意、方向难定和念头纠缠都有珠子依据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"只写抽象的亲近感及其与当下处境的落差，没有落实成具体旧场景、人物关系或真实外部行动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"轻松未能解决问题、硬撑后的疲倦以及决定重新浮现都有珠子和前段心理状态的依据，没有把音乐变化当作心理原因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S03-1\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"前条的自我安慰失效和不安回拉能解释后续的纠缠与失衡，却没有直接推出“不服气的怒意”这一具体转变。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"三条呈现了失衡、亲近感带来的暂时转移及现状落差、轻松退去后决定回返的顺序，主线清楚。\"\n  ,\n  \"lost\": [],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S03-3\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"一条把处境未变、硬撑疲倦、轻松退去后想起决定三层信息用分号串起，略显堆叠，而且“处境未变”与上一条的现状落差有些重复。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "045ce537-8d5c-45b1-b205-02914df8789a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T053137570263Z", "elapsed_seconds": 293.469, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T05:36:31.051211+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c397292d56560763e919983262cfd3f0c56107fd32e52ea848fcf0addaa9cc05", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe3